flowchart TD
  F[Field plus resolved value] --> A{Page exists and rectangle is on page?}
  A -- No --> E1[Error: off-page]
  A -- Yes --> M{Inside printable margin?}
  M -- No --> W1[Warning: outside printable area]
  M -- Yes --> O{Overlaps another field?}
  O -- Yes --> E2[Error: field overlap]
  O -- No --> I{Covers source-form ink?}
  I -- Yes --> W2[Warning: ink overlap]
  I -- No --> V{Formatted value fits?}
  V -- No --> E3[Error or warning: overflow]
  V -- Yes --> OK[Ready to render]